From: elpaablo <donopwhile1@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 14 Jun 2026 11:00:36 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/9] av: add OPlus CameraService extension support

Add the CameraServiceExt factory (ext/) that dlopens system_ext/lib64/
libcsextimpl.so and wires OPlus camera-service extension transactions (zoom / UI
events) through CameraService, plus the supporting CameraProviderManager,
Camera3OutputUtils and CameraSessionStats hooks. Required for the APS v2 path.
